# Redcap Melee deals 4 damage to Bot2's Blazing Rootwalla, a red permanent: it dies, but only a nonred permanent dealt
# damage makes the caster sacrifice a land, so Bot1 keeps both lands and is not asked to choose one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mountain
Redcap Melee
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Blazing Rootwalla
Mountain x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Blazing Rootwalla.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Redcap Melee.Cast(Blazing Rootwalla)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Blazing Rootwalla
Bot1.Graveyard = Redcap Melee
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mountain
